      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِبْتَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>manner, form, state,</i> or <i>condition,
in which a thing grows,</i> or <i>germinates.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُ لَحَسَنُ النِّبْتَةِ</span> <i>Verily he,</i> or <i>it, is of a goodly
manner, &amp;c., of growth.</i> (L.)

